# ORBIT backend. Leave both blank to run the fully offline demo (localStorage).
# Fill them in with your Supabase project's values to join the shared galaxy.
# Find these under Project Settings -> API.
#
# For a hosted project use the absolute URL:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
#
# For the local stack reached through the work-host preview, use the relative
# path `/sb`. The dev server (see vite.config.ts) proxies it to 127.0.0.1:54321,
# so the browser stays on its own origin and needs no tunnel or CORS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=/sb
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
